e co-located cost.json files — token cost (cache vs normal) and frozen USD per primary objective, summed per logbook, per roadmap, and per project; crosses with the usage heat map to project USD per person per month. Zero-LLM bash aggregation.","headings":["Command: /waves:cost — the economic sensor (cost report)","What it reads vs writes","Step 0: Language","Step 0.5: Parse arguments","Step 1: Discover the cost snapshots (degrade gracefully)","Step 2: Aggregate (zero-LLM)","Step 3: Cross with usage (`--cross` only)","Step 4: Render the cost report"]},{"path":"commands/diverged-work-create.md","name":"diverged-work-create","description":"Capture a small unit of divergent work that surfaced mid-flight (during design or testing) as a diverged_work artifact — gather it, run an adversarial 3-gate audit, and either execute it now (disposition=executable) or promote it to a full logbook (disposition=promoted).","headings":["Command: /waves:diverged-work-create — lightweight divergent-work artifact","Multi-project scope","Step -1: Prerequisites Check (CRITICAL)","Step 0: Read-before-act gate (rule #4)","Step 0.5: Smart Wave Detection","Step 1: Gather the diverged_work (human-in-the-loop)","Step 2: Adversarial 3-gate audit (analyst A — assigns disposition)","Step 3: Main agent re-judges (verifier B — A->B pattern, design_principle #7)"]},{"path":"commands/feasibility-analyze.md","name":"feasibility-analyze","description":"Pre-blueprint feasibility and market analysis with Monte Carlo and Bayesian projections","headings":["Command: /feasibility-analyze","Your Role","Step -1: Prerequisites Check (CRITICAL)","Step 0: Parameter and Flow Detection","Step 1: Idea Discovery (Conversational, Proactive)","Step 2: User Resources","Step 3: Market Analysis","Step 4: Buyer Personas"]},{"path":"commands/foundation-create.md","name":"foundation-create","description":"Compact feasibility analysis into validated facts for blueprint creation","headings":["Command: /foundation-create","Your Role","Step -1: Prerequisites Check (CRITICAL)","Step 0: Locate Feasibility Analysis","Step 1: Extract & Enrich Problem Statement","Step 2: Compact Target Users from Buyer Personas","Step 3: Compact Competitive Landscape","Step 4: Compact Revenue Model"]},{"path":"commands/logbook-create.md","name":"logbook-create","description":"Create a new development logbook for a ticket/task with structured objectives, autonomous design resolution, code tracing, UI detection, and actionable completion guides.","headings":["Command: /waves:logbook-create","Multi-project scope","Your Role","Step -1: Prerequisites Check (CRITICAL)","Step 0: Parameter Check and Tip","Step 0.5: Smart Wave Detection (CRITICAL)","Step 1: Check Existing Logbook","Step 2: Gather Ticket/Task Information"]},{"path":"commands/logbook-update.md","name":"logbook-update","description":"Update an existing logbook with progress entries, objective status changes, new objectives, and reminders. Includes automatic history compaction.","headings":["Command: /waves:logbook-update","Multi-project scope","Your Role","Step -1: Prerequisites Check (CRITICAL)","Step 0: Parameter Check and Logbook Selection","Reserved instruction tokens (deterministic, no LLM interpretation)","Free-form instruction (interpreted)","Loading the logbook"]},{"path":"commands/manifest-create.md","name":"manifest-create","description":"Analyze project and create structured manifest. Supports software projects (with code analysis) and general projects (academic, creative, business).","headings":["Command: /waves:manifest-create","Multi-project scope","Your Role","Step -1: Prerequisites Check (CRITICAL)","Step 0: Command Explanation","Step 1: Check Existing Manifest","Step 2: Route to Appropriate Flow","FLOW A: SOFTWARE PROJECTS"]},{"path":"commands/manifest-update.md","name":"manifest-update","description":"Update manifest with detected project changes","headings":["Plugin Command: manifest-update","Multi-project scope","Your Role","Two entry poi